Greetings,

I am new to RHadoop. When I try to run a sample mapreduce in R, I am printing the keyval pairs in a loop but in the reducer, I am not getting any keyval pairs.

Sample program:
map.tam= function(dummy,data)
{
  split = unlist(strsplit(data,","))
  for(i in 1:length(split))
  {
    keyval(split[i], 1)
  }
}

reduce.tam=function(key, counts)
{
  keyval(key,counts)
}

runTam <-function(input)
{
  print(input)

  mapreduce.output = from.dfs(mapreduce(input,map=map.tam,reduce=reduce.tam,combine=T))
}

Can someone help me out?
